{
  "name": "obj3_step8",
  "description": "Objective 3, Step 8, knowledge path. Run eval\\calibrate_store_tau.py first (it writes results_obj3/_tau_step8/fallback.json). O3-S8a = O3-S7a + entity check (other brands, smartwatches, non-watch items, designs that do not exist: fixed reply plus real Veyra matches, no model call) + hard fallback on store questions only, below the recalibrated threshold and only when no code or catalogue name is in the message. O3-S8 = O3-S8a + staff check (the first 'can't answer' call_staff returns a note asking the model to check what it was shown). Full dev, both models, Vulkan. About 1.5-2 hours, resumable.",
  "runs": [
    {
      "name": "o3s8a_4b_rag",
      "model": "Qwen3.5-4B",
